From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 06:03:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ports/arkweb: Return ExecuteJavaScript results to ACE

Implement the result-returning ExecuteJavaScript overload that ArkTS
runJavaScript(script, callback) routes through. The NWebMessageValueCallback
is parked by id (servo_js.cpp), the script is evaluated on the servo thread,
and the JSValue result is rendered to a string and delivered back through the
callback as a STRING NWebMessage. The fire-and-forget overload is unchanged.

Evaluation failures are delivered as an ERROR NWebMessage so the ArkTS promise
rejects, rather than resolving with an internal debug string as a fake success
value. A call arriving before the engine is running releases its parked callback
immediately, so the promise cannot hang forever.

Validation: Test by running uv run ports/arkweb/tools/test_controller.py (ControllerPage runJavaScript reports results via hilog).
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; implementation and on-device testing)
